    },
    "Automation" : {
      "comment" : "A section in the analytics settings view that allows the user to configure automation settings.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Automatisering"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AV1 encoding uses SVT-AV1 (software). No hardware acceleration available." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AV1-koding bruker SVT-AV1 (programvare). Ingen maskinvareakselerasjon tilgjengelig."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Available" : {
      "comment" : "A label indicating that the SSIMULACRA2 tool is available.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tilgjengelig"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Available variables:" : {
      "comment" : "A list of available variables that can be used in the filename template.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tilgjengelige variabler:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AVC-Intra 50 uses the least bandwidth and is suited for SD/720p. AVC-Intra 100 is the standard for 1080i/1080p broadcast delivery. AVC-Intra 200 provides the highest quality with full 10-bit 4:2:2 at higher bitrates." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AVC-Intra 50 bruker minst båndbredde og passer for SD/720p. AVC-Intra 100 er standard for 1080i/1080p kringkastingsleveranser. AVC-Intra 200 gir høyest kvalitet med fullt 10-bit 4:2:2 på høyere bitrater."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AVC-Intra Class" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AVC-Intra klasse"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AVIF offers the best compression and quality for animated images. GIF is universally compatible but limited to 256 colors. APNG supports full-color transparency and is widely supported in web browsers." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AVIF gir best komprimering og kvalitet for animerte bilder. GIF er universelt kompatibel, men begrenset til 256 farger. APNG støtter full-farge gjennomsiktighet og støttes bredt i nettlesere."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "avmenc --cpu-used. Lower values encode slower but produce better quality at the same setting. AV2 reference encoding is very slow — higher values are useful for quick tests." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "avmenc --cpu-used. Lavere verdier koder saktere, men gir bedre kvalitet ved samme innstilling. AV2-referansekoding er svært treg – høyere verdier er nyttige for raske tester."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "avmenc --qp. Lower values mean higher quality and larger files (0 = best, 255 = smallest). Around 100–130 is a reasonable starting point for visually good quality." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "avmenc --qp. Lavere verdier gir høyere kvalitet og større filer (0 = best, 255 = minst). Rundt 100–130 er et fornuftig startpunkt for visuelt god kvalitet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "avmenc --target-bitrate in kilobits per second. The encoder aims for this average bitrate across the clip." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "avmenc --target-bitrate i kilobit per sekund. Koderen sikter mot denne gjennomsnittlige bitraten gjennom klippet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "avmenc --tile-columns (log2: 1 = 2 columns, 2 = 4, …) for the single-process path. 0 = Auto, which picks a tile count from the resolution. Ignored when Parallel Chunks is active." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "avmenc --tile-columns (log2: 1 = 2 kolonner, 2 = 4, …) for enkeltprosess-banen. 0 = Auto, som velger antall fliser ut fra oppløsningen. Ignoreres når Parallelle biter er aktiv."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "avmenc --tile-rows (log2) for the single-process path. 0 = Auto (chosen from the frame height). Ignored when Parallel Chunks is active." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "avmenc --tile-rows (log2) for enkeltprosess-banen. 0 = Auto (velges ut fra bildehøyden). Ignoreres når Parallelle biter er aktiv."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "avmenc -t for the single-process path. 0 lets the app use all available cores." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "avmenc -t for enkeltprosess-banen. 0 lar appen bruke alle tilgjengelige kjerner."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avoid special characters like em dashes (—) in prefix, suffix, or comments. They may cause metadata to not be written correctly." : {
