    "Bundles FFmpeg, mpv, tesseract, asdcplib and bmx; optionally downloads yt-dlp, Deno, rclone, whisper.cpp and Parakeet at runtime. Each component is distributed under its own license — see the Licenses folder in the source repository for bundled components' full terms." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the license for Aagedal Media Converter.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Inkluderer FFmpeg, mpv, tesseract, asdcplib og bmx; laster eventuelt ned yt-dlp, Deno, rclone, whisper.cpp og Parakeet ved kjøring. Hver komponent distribueres under sin egen lisens — se Licenses-mappen i kildekoderepositoriet for de fullstendige vilkårene for inkluderte komponenter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "By default, metadata such as title, timecode, and encoder tags are stripped to keep output files clean. Color-related metadata (including HDR) is always preserved for accurate viewing." : {
      "comment" : "A tooltip explaining that color-related metadata is always preserved for accurate viewing.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
