    "Clips have different formats and cannot be concatenated into one file. Auto-split creates one encoding group per format. Toggle “Concatenate clips” off to import them as separate files instead." : {
      "comment" : "A tooltip for the \"Auto-split\" button in the Camera Card Import view.",
