    },
    "Off by default. When off, URLs pointing to LAN, loopback, link-local, or `.local` hosts are rejected. Turn on to download from a local media server (Jellyfin, Plex, etc.)." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the `allowPrivateNetworkDownloads` setting.",
