    },
    "PNG is lossless and widely compatible. TIFF and EXR are preferred for VFX pipelines. DPX is standard for film scanning. JPEG and JPEG XL are lossy but produce smaller files. JPEG 2000 is used in DCP workflows." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PNG er tapsfri og bredt kompatibel. TIFF og EXR foretrekkes i VFX-pipeliner. DPX er standard for filmskanning. JPEG og JPEG XL er med tap, men gir mindre filer. JPEG 2000 brukes i DCP-arbeidsflyter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
